OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine and a very low risk of a
OL,8,Flight shower over southern parts.
OL,9,FOvernight will remain dry with clear
OL,10,Fspells, but feeling a little warmer
OL,11,Fthan recent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAnother dry, fine and warm day
OL,14,Ffor much of the country. However,
OL,15,Fthicker cloud will move into northern
OL,16,Fparts later in the day, with some
OL,17,Fpatchy rain arriving after dark.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
